{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-07_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-07","title":"感染","storyCode":"0-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9a0edab3063426c2cbb8a5d52912faa888eddb116195ef4213c1836f553b92d7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"喘息之際，眾人討論起整合運動的古怪行動。\n在短暫的討論中，杜賓指出，如果對方的領袖如她所想，那麼一切或許只是剛剛開始。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——天空越來越暗淡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"天際線仿佛被雲層捏住了一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明明空氣很通透，烏雲卻靜止不動，好像在把各處的壓抑感通通抽出，凝聚在一處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"連風都停下了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"天災確實，即將降臨在這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，切爾諾伯格已經被整合運動徹底癱瘓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，哪怕是要拆分移動城市，也應該提前數周就完成準備工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"難道在那時候，整合運動就......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不太現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的整合運動，並沒有體現出秘密接管所需要的精英部隊素質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的大多數成員......不過是在街頭遊蕩，向切爾諾伯格人尋仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是在各處重複著殺戮和戰鬥，使整個城市陷入戰火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"天災降臨時，就連無比堅固的切爾諾伯格都會被撕得粉碎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"變成佈滿源石的巨型廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"無論整合運動想要的是資源還是名望，都只會一敗塗地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們真能和烏薩斯軍方正面對抗嗎？即使烏薩斯的指揮系統陷入了混亂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的軍事力量，怎麼還沒有集結反攻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"從我的經驗來說，一般暴亂發生後，不出片刻，暴徒就會被全副武裝的軍警清剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然，我們剛才也見證了一小撮軍警被整合運動圍攻的景象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那個蒙面的整合運動頭目，即使是有一點不同......但她也沒有能夠吞沒一城的水準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"除非什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前經歷的戰爭中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"也有行為與整合運動的掌控者如出一轍的領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"於他而言，士兵不過是棋子，達到目的後就可以隨意丟棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"既合理高效地運用兵力，又在不需要的時候放縱其自生自滅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"因為訓練與管理的成本太高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他只是放養他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"對。大多數時候，他只要把仇恨和恐慌當做口糧，餵養他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"只需在必要時，輕輕地推一下——追隨者就會振臂高呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果整合運動的運作，真如他們宣傳的那般......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"穿上衣服，戴上標誌，所有的感染者都可以是整合運動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"他們確實......將源源不斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"被壓迫、想要呼喊的感染者太多了。這時候，無論整合運動給出的是怎樣的出路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要在鐵屋子上鑽個口，哪怕外面就是一片火海，裡面的人依然會互相推搡著探出身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你我不同。即使我還沒有完全信任你，但至少我信任你的能力。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"與你完全不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這種領袖並不是指揮官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"踐踏敵人，同時也踐踏同伴，又或者說，“隨從”，的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"也許連隨從都算不上，整合運動的暴徒，不過是領袖的棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的人，是暴君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"無論敵人是誰，我們都會完成任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"以前有人訓導過我和我的隊友——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果是棋子，那就吃掉；如果是堡壘，那就攻陷；如果是王權，那就推翻”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace......稍等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，正前方，盤踞著敵人的輕裝甲部隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被發現了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我們避不開。這是這條路徑中的最短路線，如果我們迂回，就會損失時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那沒什麼好說的了。無論他們是棋子還是暴徒，只要從戰場上趕出去就好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]}]}
